#. module: account_qr_code_emv
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_qr_code_emv
msgid ""
"\n"
"Bridge module addings support for EMV Merchant-Presented QR-code generation "
"for Payment System.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"ໂມດູນເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສຳລັບການຮອງຮັບການສ້າງລະຫັດ QR ແບບ EMV Merchant-Presented ສຳລັບລະບົບການຊຳລະ"
"ເງິນ.\n"

#. module: account_qr_code_emv
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_qr_code_emv/models/res_bank.py:0
msgid "A bank account is required for EMV QR Code generation."
msgstr "ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີບັນຊີທະນາຄານເພື່ອສ້າງລະຫັດ EMV QR Code."

